sequenceDiagram
    actor Citizen
    participant Web as React Portal
    participant API as ASP.NET Web API
    participant DB as SQL Server
    Citizen->>Web: Complete assistance form + map pin
    Web->>API: POST /api/requests (JWT)
    API->>API: Validate identity, crisis & inputs
    API->>DB: Insert Request, History, Audit
    DB-->>API: Commit
    API-->>Web: 201 Created + case identifier
    Web-->>Citizen: Receipt and Submitted status
